PASS LA_Ready sent on load
PASS Down arrows play UIMenuFocus
PASS E adds the focused effect - [["LA_AddEffect","mw.fire_damage"]]
PASS editor open for new effect
PASS Right -> LA_EditorStep(min,+1,false) - [["LA_EditorStep","min",1,false],["LA_EditorStep","min",1,false],["LA_EditorStep","min",1,false]]
PASS Shift+Right -> LA_EditorStep(min,+1,true)
PASS Down then Right -> LA_EditorStep(max,+1,false)
PASS F -> LA_EditorRange
PASS editor shows DLL values (min 15, max 17) - [15,17]
PASS Enter in editor -> LA_EditorOk
PASS effect row added
PASS add plays the add sound
PASS D switches school tabs (UIMenuPrevNext)
